The {{Term/Store|Evil Spirit Set||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Piggyback 403"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Phantom Ganon Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="BotW Adventure Log"/> is an [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Phantom Ganon Set is an [[Armor Set]] comprised of the [[Evil Spirit Mask|Phantom Ganon Skull]], [[Evil Spirit Armor|Phantom Ganon Armor]], and [[Evil Spirit Greaves|Phantom Ganon Greaves]]. They can be obtained through the [[Side Quest]] "[[EX Treasure: Dark Armor]]", which is available after reading ''[[Misko's EX Journal 2]]'' in the [[Deya Village Ruins]].<ref name="BotW Misko's EX Journal 2"/> The pieces of the set can be found in the following locations in the [[Faron Woods]].
* Within [[Corta Lake]]
* Under [[Sarjon Bridge]]
* In [[Ebara Forest]]

Each individual piece of the Phantom Ganon Set will increase [[Link]]'s [[Stealth]] when worn. The full set can be worn to give Link the [[Set Bonus#Disguise|Disguise]] [[Set Bonus]] against [[Stalkoblin]]s, [[Stalmoblin]]s, and [[Stalizalfos]]. He'll also receive the [[Set Bonus#Bone Atk. Up|Bone Atk. Up]] Set Bonus, which will increase his attack when using bone weaponry.

The Phantom Ganon Set is unable to be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]]. Similarly, it can't be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. Characters who see Link wearing the Phantom Ganon Set will be temporarily frightened. It is modeled after [[Phantom Ganon]] from {{OoT}}.

